		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Message d'erreur pg_query() expects parameter 2]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=30366#p30366"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>En lisant la documentation de pg_query?</p><div class="quotebox"><cite>https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.pg-query.php a écrit&#160;:</cite><blockquote><div><p>Return Values</p><p>A query result resource on success or FALSE on failure.</p></div></blockquote></div><p>$clients est donc inapproprié.</p>]]></content>
